## 🔗 Send Downloads to Your Mac Remotely

### 📱 From iPhone or iPad

📲 Come across a PDF, archive, installer, document, or other downloadable file while using your iPhone or iPad?

🔗 Send the link to Transloader and assign it to the Mac that should perform the download.

💻 Your selected Mac receives the request and starts handling the download.

### 💻 From Another Mac

🖥️ Transloader also supports Mac-to-Mac workflows.

🔗 Send a link to another connected Mac instead of manually opening the browser and finding the same page again.

### ☁️ iCloud Keeps Devices Connected

☁️ Transloader uses your iCloud account to synchronize supported information between Macs, iPhones, and iPads.

📋 Added download links and relevant device metadata can stay synchronized across your Transloader setup.

### 🚀 Simple Remote Workflow

| 🪜 Step | 📥 Action                             |
| ------- | ------------------------------------- |
| 1️⃣ 🔗  | 🌐 Find the download link             |
| 2️⃣ 📱  | 📲 Send it through Transloader        |
| 3️⃣ 💻  | 🎯 Select the target Mac              |
| 4️⃣ ☁️  | 🔄 Let iCloud synchronize the request |
| 5️⃣ 📥  | 🚀 Target Mac starts the download     |
| 6️⃣ 🔔  | 📣 Receive status notifications       |

