## 📂 File Actions — Automate Completed Downloads

🚀 Transloader doesn't have to stop when the download finishes.

📂 **File Actions** allow downloaded files to trigger additional actions based on their filename extension, UTI, or source domain.

### 🧩 Automate Your Downloads

| 📁 Downloaded File    | ⚙️ Possible Workflow                       |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| 📦 ZIP Archive        | 🗂️ Open or process automatically          |
| 🎬 Video              | 🎞️ Send to a compatible video application |
| 🎵 Audio              | 🎧 Process with another application        |
| 📄 Document           | 📝 Open with a selected application        |
| 💾 Installer          | 🧩 Trigger a configured workflow           |
| 🌐 Specific Host File | ⚙️ Apply a host-specific action            |

### 🤖 Automator & Shortcuts

⚡ File Actions can work with Automator workflows and Shortcuts for more advanced automation.

🔄 This makes Transloader useful as part of larger Mac workflows instead of functioning only as a basic downloader.

