## 🔐 Login-Protected Downloads

🔑 Some downloads are available only after signing into the website that hosts the file.

🍪 Transloader can use supported login cookies to handle these authenticated downloads.

### 🔑 HTTP Basic Authorization

🛡️ Recent Transloader versions also support HTTP Basic Authorization for compatible sites.

☁️ Supported authentication information can be synchronized through iCloud.

### 🌐 Login Before Downloading

🔐 You can log into websites you expect to download from before initiating the remote download.

### 🔄 Login After the Download Request

📥 If a download requires authentication after being added, Transloader can detect the login requirement and allow the login process to be completed before restarting the download.

### 🛡️ Authentication Workflow

| 🔐 Stage    | ⚙️ Transloader Action                       |
| ----------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| 🌐 Website  | 🔗 Open the required service                |
| 🔑 Login    | 🛡️ Authenticate with supported credentials |
| 🍪 Session  | ☁️ Sync supported login information         |
| 📥 Download | 🚀 Start the requested file transfer        |
| 🔔 Status   | 📣 Report progress or completion            |

