## 🔔 Stay Updated With Notifications

📣 You don't have to keep checking the Transloader window to know what is happening.

### 📥 Download Notifications

🔔 Transloader can notify you about important download states, including completed or failed downloads.

### 💻 Mac Status Notifications

🖥️ Notifications can also tell you when Transloader launches on a connected Mac.

😴 You can be informed when a Mac goes to sleep.

🛑 You can also receive status information when Transloader quits.

| 🔔 Event               | 📣 Notification           |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------- |
| 📥 Download Finished   | ✅ Completion notification |
| ❌ Download Failed      | ⚠️ Failure notification   |
| 🚀 Transloader Started | 🟢 Launch notification    |
| 😴 Mac Sleeps          | 🌙 Sleep notification     |
| 🛑 Transloader Quits   | 🔴 Quit notification      |

### 🎯 Why Notifications Matter

📱 Remote downloads are most useful when you don't have to repeatedly open the target Mac just to check progress.

🔔 Transloader keeps you informed while you continue working on another device.

