## 🛡️ Privacy & iCloud Architecture

🔐 Transloader's developer states that the application does not collect or transmit user data to the developer or third parties.

☁️ iCloud is used to synchronize supported Transloader information between your devices.

📋 This includes added links, device-related metadata, and optional login cookies or authentication information you provide.

🌐 Your internet connection is used to provide Transloader's download and synchronization functionality.

### 🔒 Privacy Overview

